      {
        "id": 12546,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-04T07:23:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We have seen promo Scholar before</p>\n<p>On \"Expect the Worst\" - maybe more</p>\n<p>The text on the same</p>\n<p>is in Fanatic's name</p>\n<p>Was she there when he saw what was in store?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><font color=\"white\">For those of you who don't want to have to interpret my poetry: &nbsp;I don't have the cards in front of me, but I'm pretty sure that when Scholar is pictured on Expect the Worst, he has the markings of Scholar of the Infinate. &nbsp;And the flavor text of Expect the Worst is \"He stood, wreathed in flame, but he did not burn\" - Fanatic, Mystery Comics <span class=\"hashtag\">#281</span>. &nbsp;This sounds to me like Fanatic is present when Scholar \"sees too much\" and becomes Scholar of the Infinite. I don't know what they were doing, but I have a strong hunch that it involves the Host. &nbsp;Possibly Biomancer, but I'm leaning towards the Host. &nbsp;Thoughts?</font></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:07.138Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
