        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "We have seen promo Scholar before\n\nOn &quot;Expect the Worst&quot; - maybe more\n\nThe text on the same\n\nis in Fanatic&#39;s name\n\nWas she there when he saw what was in store?\n\n&nbsp;\n\n[color=white]For those of you who don&#39;t want to have to interpret my poetry: &nbsp;I don&#39;t have the cards in front of me, but I&#39;m pretty sure that when Scholar is pictured on Expect the Worst, he has the markings of Scholar of the Infinate. &nbsp;And the flavor text of Expect the Worst is &quot;He stood, wreathed in flame, but he did not burn&quot; - Fanatic, Mystery Comics #281. &nbsp;This sounds to me like Fanatic is present when Scholar &quot;sees too much&quot; and becomes Scholar of the Infinite. I don&#39;t know what they were doing, but I have a strong hunch that it involves the Host. &nbsp;Possibly Biomancer, but I&#39;m leaning towards the Host. &nbsp;Thoughts?[/color]\n",
